Network libraries: the offline model (a console with no link, not signed in to PSN) for the network imports of A Crack
in Time 1.20, All 4 One 1.03, Into the Nexus 1.01, Full Frontal Assault 1.05 and Deadlocked HD that had no handler or
only a stub, plus the SDK's error values in every library touched (several tables here were made up).

Rule: return what a real offline / not-signed-in PS3 returns; never CELL_OK for an operation that could not happen.
Error names, values, argument checks and their order are facts read from RPCS3's module sources (reference only, no
code taken); guesses are marked ASSUMPTION in the code. With the online switch (KZ3_ONLINE / psnr sign-in) the online
side keeps working as before; where psnr has no such service the answer is the service's own "unavailable" error.

  * cellHttp: the 16 cellHttpClientSet*/Close/Poll calls and cellHttpRequestSetContentLength (stored settings, client
    headers copied into each transaction; PollConnections NO_CONNECTION with no open socket); RPCS3 error values.
  * cellNetCtl library: cellGameUpdateInit/Term/CheckStartAsync/CheckStartWithoutDialogAsync/CheckFinishAsync (the
    callback reports STATUS_ERROR + NET_NOT_CONNECTED offline, NO_UPDATE online, FINISHED on finish).
  * cellSsl: every certificate getter answers INVALID_CERTIFICATE (no handshake ever produced one); 0x8074xxxx codes.
  * cellRudp: rewritten to the SDK API (Init/End, EnableInternalIOThread, SetEventHandler, CreateContext, SetOption,
    GetContextStatus, GetRemoteInfo, Bind, Initiate -> CONN_TIMEOUT, Terminate, Read/Write NOT_ACCEPTABLE,
    GetSizeReadable/Writable 0); the invented Connect/Send/Recv/... are gone.
  * sceNp: ManagerRequestTicket, GetAvatarUrl (OFFLINE), SubSignin (OFFLINE), SubSignout (ID_NOT_FOUND).
    sceNpBasic: SendMessageGui/AddFriend (NOT_CONNECTED), AddPlayersHistory (local), friend/block-list lookups
    (ID_NOT_FOUND), RecvMessageAttachmentLoad (INVALID_DATA_ID), RecvMessageCustom (CANCEL), GetEvent and
    RegisterContextSensitiveHandler checks. sceNpSignaling: Deactivate/TerminateConnection (CONN_NOT_FOUND).
    sceNpLookup: NpIdAsync, TitleSmallStorageAsync (INVALID_ONLINE_ID). sceNpScore: GetClansRankingByRange/ByClanIdAsync
    (context handlers; the transaction ends with INVALID_ONLINE_ID).
  * sceNp2 (Matching2): ClearEventData, GetUserInfoList, GetRoomDataExternalList, SetRoomMemberDataInternal
    (SERVER_NOT_AVAILABLE). sceNpCommerce2: DoProductBrowseStartAsync (SCE_NP_ERROR_OFFLINE) / FinishAsync.
  * sceNpTus: rewritten to the SDK API (title / transaction contexts, the Async calls, Poll/Wait/Abort); not signed in,
    CreateTransactionCtx and every request answer INVALID_ONLINE_ID. SetData[Async] (nine arguments) are context handlers.
  * sceNpClans: rewritten to the SDK API (request handles, 35 calls); local Init/Term/requests, every server call
    SERVICE_UNAVAILABLE after its argument checks.
sys_net (libnet) is patch 7033. Host test: port/rc/tests/run_net_test.sh (R&C repo), gcc and clang, with 7033.

